   - Returns a `std::string_view` pointing to the data up to (but not including) the terminator
   - Automatically advances the read position past the terminator

This approach uses both the `buffer_adaptor`'s `read` method for binary data and `binary_stream`'s `view` method for null-terminated strings, as requested.

